# Go build output
/lydite
*.exe
*.test
*.out

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# goreleaser build artifacts
dist/

# Reports a command writes: the log per check, the coverage report, and the
# document `lydite publish` renders the pull-request comment from. lydite writes
# into the repository it is measuring, and what it writes must never become part
# of what it measures — a committed report directory matches no component and so
# widens affected selection to everything on every change. The directory also
# disowns itself with a .gitignore of its own, for a consumer whose repository
# has not written this line.
.lydite-reports/

# Installed dependencies. A JavaScript component's are installed by lydite from
# the committed lockfile, which is the declaration; the tree they produce is not.
node_modules/

# `wrangler dev`'s local state — a miniflare cache and a trace store, written
# beside the Worker it is running. Committed, it lands in the diff, matches no
# component, and so widens affected selection to everything on every change:
# the same failure .lydite-reports/ disowns itself to avoid.
.wrangler/

# Agentic toolkit generated config
/.claude/
/CLAUDE.md
/.mcp.json

# Python bytecode from the CI assertion scripts.
__pycache__/
